Kloofendal 48d Partly Cloudy (Pure Sky)
Original photography by Greg Zaal. Pure-sky editing by Jarod Guest.
Source: https://polyhaven.com/a/kloofendal_48d_partly_cloudy_puresky
License: CC0 1.0 Universal — https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The embedded WebP uses the upper hemisphere of the 4K Radiance panorama. The daylight exposure and white balance are baked for offline use. Longitude is rotated to place the sun at a world azimuth of -135 degrees and an elevation of 47.89 degrees.
